{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06638","headline":"闲居 · 储光羲","name":"闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄游何所媿，所媿在闲居。\n亲故不来往，中园时读书。\n步栏滴余雪，春塘抽新蒲。\n梧桐渐覆井，时鸟自相呼。\n悠然念故乡，乃在天一隅。\n安得如浮云，来往方须臾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}